# Build-time configuration loaded in EVERY Vite mode (dev preview and the
# production bundle alike). Values here are baked into the public JS bundle, so
# ONLY public-by-design values belong in this file. Never add a private key,
# API secret, or token.
#
# Canvas must look identical on every device and in every account. Anything
# mode-specific (a dev-only fallback, a separate .env.production copy of these
# same keys) produces a second visual variation, which is a bug — the Base44
# preview and the published app showed two different basemaps because of it.
# Keep the Canvas basemap defined here and nowhere else.

# Basemap: CARTO Voyager (light, colorful) on the same CARTO origin Precision
# already ships (src/components/map/BaseMapTiles.jsx), so this adds no new
# provider dependency. Swap to a keyed provider or a PMTiles archive later by
# changing this one line — every device follows it.
VITE_CANVAS_BASEMAP_TILE_URL=https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}{r}.png
VITE_CANVAS_BASEMAP_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors &copy; CARTO